swimlane Every directive at once
// direction-tb, frame (subtitle/source/footnotes/byline), tag group colouring, pools, and every node token. Look for tag colours overriding lane colour and footer lines under the chart.
direction-tb
subtitle Top-to-bottom, pools, tags and frame
footnote
  - Risk levels are guesses.
  - Pirates not included.

  **Source:** Sea Office, 1721

  Chart: First Mate

tag Risk as r
  Low green
  High red

pool Merchant
  ~> Cargo spotted

pool Raiders
  lane Gunners red
    (Cargo spotted) message -> Fire warning
    Fire warning type: manual, r: Low
      -> <Surrender?>
    <Surrender?>
      -yes-> Board ship
      -no-> Fire broadside
    Fire broadside type: manual, r: High
      (Smoke) signal -> Fire warning
      -> Board ship
    Board ship type: manual, r: High, note: Mind the cutlasses
      ~> Merchant
      -> [[Loot hold]]
  lane Cook orange
    [[Loot hold]] type: manual, store: Treasure chest -> Feast
    Feast type: manual, data: Menu -> (Merry) success
